   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Science and Technology Program - III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM HAS BEEN STRUCTURED INTO 3 COMPONENTS: THE FINANCING OF PROJECTS FOR SCIENTIFIC RESEARCH AND TECHNOLOGICAL DEVELOPMENT; STRENGTNENING OF HUMAN RESOURCES CAPABILITIES; DISEMINATION AND INFORMATION ON SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY; IN ADDITION RESOURCES WILL BE INCLUDED FOR A COMPONENT FOR THE ADMINISTRATION OF THE PROGRAM AND FOR STUDIES ON PROSPECTIVE TECHNOLOGIES</narrative>
